{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"books-space-station","chapterId":"book-190287","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["LocalbookConfig:190287","BookSeriesConfig:141"],"orderNote":"BookSeriesID, BookSeriesInsideID order; collection state is not inferred.","book":{"id":190287,"seriesId":141,"volume":1,"bookshelf":true,"hasImages":false},"rows":[{"id":"books-space-station-book-190287","entryId":"books-space-station","chapterId":"book-190287","missionId":"book-series-141","mission":"연구원들의 남김말 메모","scene":"첫 번째","speaker":"","type":"narration","text":"——제길, 비밀번호가 왜 또 바뀐 거야?\n\n——비밀번호는 ██████ 입니다. 기억하세요, 비밀번호는 ██████.입니다!\n\n——누가 이렇게 매너 없이 비밀번호를 칠해놨어! 다른 사람들도 써야지!\n\n——그래서 지금 비밀번호가 대체 뭐야, 누구 아는 사람?","talkId":null,"textHash":"8545434025142253258","source":"LocalbookConfig:190287/BookContent"}]}
